{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2024-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1725148800, "end_date": 1725753599, "month_true_total": 24, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:24:29 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "174465917", "author": {"steamid": "76561199006743271", "personaname": "Scary Orange", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199006743271/", "num_games_owned": 295, "num_reviews": 114, "playtime_forever": 43, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25, "last_played": 1787288707, "avatar": "7661caf6ffad9939d09485e5cca1280496eb4f53"}, "language": "english", "review": "After Hopoo Games recent closure, is a delight to dive into their old catalog and see how, even at their most amateurish. were able to create and develop such a fun and charming expirience. it is amazing that the same people that made this small, quirky, kinda ugly looking roguelike would later give us one of the the greatest games of all time. \r\n\r\nFly high, Hopoo Games. and i wish Paul and Duncan the best at VALVe.", "timestamp_created": 1725736510, "timestamp_updated": 1725736510, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174395042", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040710852", "personaname": "⛧Mλrissa⛧", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mari-succuboos/", "num_games_owned": 1267, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 1264, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 644, "last_played": 1725754904, "avatar": "63096c267d12fe8e3d9cf4d85ef30b1bceabb9dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's like eating a bowl of broken glass shards - but you get called bad and told to \"git gud\" when you say you're not really enjoying the experience and would rather try something else.\n\nOST kicks ass though.", "timestamp_created": 1725665129, "timestamp_updated": 1725665129, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.499687135219573975", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174323122", "author": {"steamid": "76561198246710616", "personaname": "Sceptizard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sceptizard/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2531, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2353, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1215, "last_played": 1763876447, "avatar": "347458036fb085949d84591d20cd445e245cfadc"}, "language": "english", "review": "It was truly challenging :)", "timestamp_created": 1725589407, "timestamp_updated": 1725589407, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52191239595413208", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174313077", "author": {"steamid": "76561199086686178", "personaname": "~57 million crows", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/impulse265/", "num_games_owned": 404, "num_reviews": 307, "playtime_forever": 730, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 328, "last_played": 1759610543, "avatar": "6b1972446f37d6846120055d8a6b656eb1d1c697"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game, but if you want to play it i'd recommend getting Risk of Rain Returns instead, as it has better controls, more content, redone art and music, and a new gamemode.\n\nHowever, if you love Risk of Rain Returns and want more, consider getting this for the mods that it has. Specifically Starstorm, as it adds a whole lot of new content, survivors, items, locations, and such. 10/10 mod", "timestamp_created": 1725577174, "timestamp_updated": 1727234438, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174237178", "author": {"steamid": "76561199050877711", "personaname": "PearlescentMusic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199050877711/", "num_games_owned": 51, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 1811, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 1112, "last_played": 1790295946, "avatar": "4dea41211fd89025df99a0f093c72a306325a048"}, "language": "english", "review": "i played both the sequel and the remake to this game before playing the og and my god does it hold up. I adore this game, despite being less detailed than anything else later, there just something about the game that makes it so fun, as well as it having the cutest version of acrid the franchise has seen. I've beat the game twice and have unlocked every character. Its worth the 10 bucks it costs. My one nitpick is that you have to kill every enemy on a stage before progressing, but you immediately get over that once you realize that you can just have the teleporter running while looting the stage. amazing game.", "timestamp_created": 1725487541, "timestamp_updated": 1739978599, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_rel